{"n":101,"name":"القارعة","nameEn":"Al-Qariah","meaning":"The Striking Hour","revealed":"Makkah","ayahs":11,"translation":"Mufti Taqi Usmani","verses":[{"n":1,"ar":"اَلۡقَارِعَةُۙ‏","en":"The Striking Event!"},{"n":2,"ar":"مَا الۡقَارِعَةُۚ‏","en":"What is the Striking Event?"},{"n":3,"ar":"وَمَا٘ اَدۡرٰىكَ مَا الۡقَارِعَةُؕ‏","en":"And what may let you know what the Striking Event is?"},{"n":4,"ar":"يَوۡمَ يَكُوۡنُ النَّاسُ كَالۡفَرَاشِ الۡمَبۡثُوۡثِۙ‏","en":"(It will happen) on a day when people will be like scattered moths,"},{"n":5,"ar":"وَتَكُوۡنُ الۡجِبَالُ كَالۡعِهۡنِ الۡمَنۡفُوۡشِؕ‏","en":"and the mountains will be like carded wool."},{"n":6,"ar":"فَاَمَّا مَنۡ ثَقُلَتۡ مَوَازِيۡنُهٗۙ‏","en":"Then, as for him whose scales (of good deeds) are heavy,"},{"n":7,"ar":"فَهُوَ فِيۡ عِيۡشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍؕ‏","en":"he will be in a happy life."},{"n":8,"ar":"وَاَمَّا مَنۡ خَفَّتۡ مَوَازِيۡنُهٗۙ‏","en":"But he whose scales are light,"},{"n":9,"ar":"فَاُمُّهٗ هَاوِيَةٌؕ‏","en":"-his abode will be Abyss."},{"n":10,"ar":"وَمَا٘ اَدۡرٰىكَ مَا هِيَهۡؕ‏","en":"And what may let you know what that (Abyss) is?"},{"n":11,"ar":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌࣖ‏","en":"A blazing Fire!"}]}